        "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r267547428-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html",
        "title": "Wow Amazing",
        "text": "Wow what a place. We only had half an hour and were amazed at how lovely the surroundings were, Just wished had visited in the day time. Removed shoes and some kind soul assisted us to go all around the Temple as what to do where - was like god sent! They have a river flowing at the back where cremation takes place. If one is lucky, you will meet some spiritually blessed Sadhus.\nA must visit.\nPlease do not take photos - i was screamed at by a security officer in a very very rude tone -- something he could have done calmly and politely.",
