        "title": "VISIT TO THE TEMPLE ON A RAINY DAY",
        "text": "Couple of Days we couldn't do Pashupatinath Temple on our Tour because we were late in Reaching to the Temple in the Evening but Finally we got our Chance to Visit here on Monday Morning just before we could leave to the Kathmandu Airport. It was Raining in early April. The Shops outside the Temple helped us with an umbrella so that we could visit the temple nicely. It is a Huge Temple and There were lots of Tourists in there and ofcourse many localites as well. It Took us sometime really to Visit the Temple as the Area and the Facade is huge. There were people in Lakhs out there. We Could not miss this on our Way to Kathmandu as we had heard a lot and really its a Beautiful temple to Visit. Must Visit place in Kathmandu",
